## Verdicts

```mdl
verdict QA-1: The autocue demo drives install, draw and import with the real agent, but skips the change step and checks no expectation.
  status: partial
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/devtools/drawing/autocue/agent-demo.sh]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/devtools/drawing/autocue/agent-demo.mjs]
  note: |
    `agent-demo.sh` runs `npx skills add ... --skill drawing`; `agent-demo.mjs` asks for `arch.dx`, prints its
    source and runs `dx drawing import arch.dx.svg`, then opens it in Composer. There is no "Group Stripe and
    Postmark" step, no check that `SKILL.md`, `arch.dx.svg` or a Drawing named "arch" exists, and the script needs
    a signed-in `claude`, so it runs as a manual recording rather than in CI.
```
